     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello <span style=\"font-size:small\"> Dr. Chalmers</span>,<div>I am running a concurrent analysis for equating mixed items format tests, and I am using multiGroup function.</div><div>When it tries to calculate the model convergence, it takes extremely long ( I was kind of expecting as it is lot of data), but the problem is that I get this message:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt; mod.mgi&lt;-multipleGroup(mate123, model=1, group=GID, invariance = spec.inv, itemtype = <a href=\"http://spec.it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://spec.it&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472332018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-44yagtvAytjeI5KAMRCB\">spec.it</a>, SE=TRUE)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Iteration: 110, Log-Lik: -70716.921, Max-Change: 0.00008</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Calculating information matrix...</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Error: cannot allocate vector of size 802.5 Mb</span></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Then I run:</span></font></div><div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&gt; memory.limit()</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">[1] 8084</span></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And I don&#39;t know how to solve this issue.</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small\">Thank you very much!</span><font color=\"#111111\" face=\"Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small\">Amalia</span></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
