    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">That&#39;s not very big for a matrix.... do you happen to have a computer that has lower RAM? R is generally memory hungry, so it&#39;s good these days to use at least 8GB but preferably even higher, like 16GB+. I&#39;ve seen this issue come up in other functions too (e.g., M2()), but this to allocate is usually much larger; like something around 10GB+. HTH.</span></div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
